# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local `npm run dev` / `wrangler dev` testing.
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit real credentials.
#
# Lead-notification email doesn't use a secret here — it's sent via
# Cloudflare's native Email Workers binding (env.SEND_EMAIL), declared in
# wrangler.toml as [[send_email]] and backed by Cloudflare Email Routing
# (Cloudflare dashboard -> Email -> Email Routing -> Destination addresses).
# There is currently nothing to set in this file; it's kept as a placeholder
# for any future secret (a paid API key, etc.) the Worker might need.
